@startuml Price Estimation Tool
title Price Estimation Tool
actor Customer
participant Client
participant API
database Database
participant AI

Customer -> Client: view item / estimate value
Client -> API: GET /auctions/{id}
API -> Database: authenticate user
Database --> API: user
API -> Database: get auction with items (opening_price, current_bid)
Database --> API: auction, items
API -> AI: item data (opening_price, current_bid, metadata)
AI --> API: predicted price range
API --> Client: AuctionDetailResponse (with estimated price)
Client --> Customer: show price range / estimate
@enduml
